    <solution><p><ol label="a.">
<li>
<p>Solution:</p>
<p><m>\begin{aligned}[t] 
              - \lvert 4-10 \rvert  \amp  = - \lvert -6 \rvert \\
                                         \amp  = {-6} 
          \end{aligned}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Solution:</p>
<p><m>\begin{aligned}[t] 
               \lvert -4-10 \rvert  \amp  = \lvert -14 \rvert \\
                                         \amp = {14} 
          \end{aligned}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Solution:</p>
<p><m>\begin{aligned}[t]
              -4 \lvert 10-4 \rvert \amp  = -4 \cdot \lvert 6 \rvert \\
                                          \amp  = -4 \cdot 6 \\
                                          \amp  = {-24} 
         \end{aligned}</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</solution>
